  </metadata>

  <prompt>Execute the FR-19 entity-agnostic launch test — launch Notepad with a synthetic non-Matter regardingEntity (e.g. sprk_project or a test entity) + regardingId. Verify Notepad renders and behaves identically. Document scenario in notes/entity-agnostic-launch.md.</prompt>

  <role>Spaarke QA / platform developer.</role>

  <goal>Notes doc confirms FR-19: URL contract stable across entities; Notepad reads regardingEntity generically and behaves identically.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>Design §3.6 + FR-19: reusability discipline verification. Contract fields must not encode Matter-specific assumptions.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file>projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/notes/entity-agnostic-launch.md</file>
    </relevant-files>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="spec">FR-19: verified by a test-only launcher against a synthetic non-Matter record.</constraint>
    <constraint source="spec">NFR-09: URL contract stability.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <files>
      <file>projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/spec.md</file>
      <file>projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/CLAUDE.md</file>
      <file>.claude/skills/ui-test/SKILL.md</file>
    </files>
  </knowledge>

  <steps>
    <step order="1">Identify a non-Matter entity available in the dev environment (e.g. sprk_project, sprk_event, or a test-only entity).</step>
    <step order="2">Find or create a record in that entity.</step>
    <step order="3">Manually construct the webresource URL with regardingEntity=&lt;entity&gt;&amp;regardingId=&lt;guid&gt; and open it.</step>
    <step order="4">Verify Notepad renders identically to the Matter case: top bar, editor, list dropdown, `+` button, `i` icon all functional.</step>
    <step order="5">Create a memo; verify sprk_memo record is created with sprk_regardingrecordid set to the non-Matter GUID.</step>
    <step order="6">Document the scenario + results in notes/entity-agnostic-launch.md.</step>
    <step order="7">Update TASK-INDEX.md: mark 040 ✅.</step>
    <step order="8">Document deviations in notes/.</step>
  </steps>

  <tools>
    <tool name="terminal">Shell + browser</tool>
  </tools>

  <outputs>
    <output type="docs">projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/notes/entity-agnostic-launch.md</output>
  </outputs>

  <acceptance-criteria>
    <criterion testable="true">Notepad renders and functions when regardingEntity is anything other than sprk_matter.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Created memo has sprk_regardingrecordid set to the non-Matter GUID.</criterion>
    <criterion testable="true">Behavior is identical (no Matter-specific branches or assumptions surface).</criterion>
  </acceptance-criteria>

  <notes>If the test uncovers Matter-specific behavior, file DEF-{NNN} via /project-defer-issue-tracking and fix before wrap-up.</notes>

